	(text "System-5 bus driver card Rev C (BUSDRV-C), one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Expanders      THREE MCP23017 I/O EXPANDERS ON THE 36-PIN BUS\n  sheet 3  Nano           ARDUINO NANO: I2C, EXPANDER RESET, BUS SENSE, CLOCK OUT, PROBES, HEADERS\n  sheet 4  Power          POWER, DECOUPLING, POWER LED\n\nRedrawn from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a412f362-a4b1-5abf-8bd7-e22fc8944c62"))
